 tor        - anonymizing overlay network for TCP
 tor-geoipdb - GeoIP database for Tor
Changes:
 tor (0.4.9.14-1~noble+1+tor41339.7) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * Apply the tor#41339 HSDir defensive series (patches 0001-0023): HTTP
     and onion service descriptor hardening; MetricsPort counters for
     HSDir fetches and uploads, tunneled directory requests and response
     bytes by type and previous hop, circuits and BEGIN_DIR cells by
     previous hop and by source and descriptor per minute; HSDir and
     BEGIN_DIR defenses and pressure-gated shedding of descriptor fetches
     over a byte budget, all off by default; accept the .6 option name
     HSDirDescriptorFetchLimit as a deprecated alias of
     HSDirFetchShedding (0024); restore doc/nofooter.conf.
